# Plan (opus, strong)

## Goal

`deal_map` deals `RUN_ACTS` acts of `RUN_ACT_ROWS` rows built from `RUN_MAP_PATHS` non-crossing seeded walks on a `RUN_MAP_COLUMNS` grid, each act ending at a lone boss. A `RunNode` carries its grid `column` and `next`; `Go` elsewhere is refused. Every route holds 12–16 fights (bosses counted) and ≥ 8 tiles, by construction, proven by DP on both contents. `run-sim` walks reachable nodes and prints route fights; the map screen shows the whole map, reachable nodes live; the docs agree.

## Files to touch

| File | Kind | What |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `crates/run/src/config.rs` | change | 7 constants in, 3 out, `MAP_SEEDS`, docs |
| `crates/run/src/lib.rs` | change | `RunNode.column`/`next`, layout fns, `deal_map`, `run_next_cols`, `Go` refusal, `mod map_tests` |
| `crates/run/src/map_tests.rs` | new | graph checks |
| `crates/run/src/tests.rs` | change | shape test, `autoplay`, R3583000 tests |
| `crates/run/src/walk_tests.rs` | change | `free_action`, won walks' fights |
| `crates/run/README.md` | change | entry point, Tests |
| `crates/tools/src/run_sim.rs` | change | acts, Map policy, route fights, tests |
| `crates/tools/README.md` | change | run-sim row |
| `apps/web/src/wire/generated/RunNode.ts`, `RunState.ts`, `RunPhase.ts` | change | regenerated only |
| `apps/web/src/dungeon/map/MapScreen.tsx` | change | whole map, reachable live |
| `apps/web/src/dungeon/map/RunScreen.test.tsx` | change | `node()`, `MAP`, B27 |
| `apps/web/src/dungeon/map/NodeIcon.test.tsx` | change | `node()` |
| `spec/15-dungeon-run.md` | change | table, §15.5, §15.12 |
| `spec/rulings/R3583000.md`, `spec/rulings/R3583001.md` | new | rulings |
| `spec/pending/3583.md` | new | §11 paragraphs |
| `docs/dungeon-run.md` | change | DR0 point 2, DR4, B27 |

Do not touch `.github/`, `.harness/`, `.squishy/`, `bot/`, `.claude/`, `spec/11-rulings.md`, `spec/INDEX.md` (no `spec index`), `crates/engine`, `store.ts`, CSS. Governing: §15.2, §15.5, §15.6 (fight seed `"{seed}-{row}-{col}"`), §15.12, R3496000.

## Steps

1. **`crates/run/src/config.rs`.** Replace lines 13–18 with these, in order, each with a `/// DR4…` doc:
   - `RUN_ACTS: usize = 3` (acts, each ending at its boss)
   - `RUN_ACT_ROWS: usize = 7` (strawman; rows of nodes before each boss row)
